{"id":192,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>中北大学2023年半导体与物理学院大学生创新创业训练项目立项评审会已结束。根据《关于启动2023年度大学生创新创业训练计划项目申报的通知》要求，经团队申报—学院审核—组织答辩，最终评选出优秀作品12项，拟报到学校教务处，现将名单公示如下，公示期为3月14日-3月17日，在此期间若有异议请联系王老师，地点：主楼205办公室，电话：3921786。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Zn7LbYMzCDUlUbME474MzGPLmvDo7Qe2Lz78n7nfLzQ7ol-0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyiM1hfLYh7oll4oz9Pol7YUm9sU4ffnRliLRTVM7UYnmrFM7VRMzlDo7nFLlCaLSbaptveo4OeCtn8_56O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLDg47DMz-Jqdynx&oid=1879695507&tid=1036&nid=1652&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/756A3D9E39819A2B87C0AD5509E4D2F5/4AC5568D/1F01\" vheight=\" 166px\" vwidth=\" 694px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Zn7LbYMzCDUlUbME474MzGPLmvDo7Qe2Lz78n7nfLzQ7ol-0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyiM1hfLYh7oll4oz9Pol7YUm9sU4ffnRliLRTVM7UYnmrFM7VRMzlDo7nFLlCaLSbaptveo4OeCtn8_56O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLDg47DMz-Jqdynx&oid=1879695507&tid=1036&nid=1652&e=.png\"></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://bdtywlxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Zn7LbYMzCDUlUbME474MzGPLmvDo7Qe2Lz78n7nfLzQ7ol-0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyiM1hfLYh7oll4oz9Pol7YUm9sU4ffnRliLRTVM7UYnmrFM7VRMzlDo7nFLlCaLSbaptveo4OeCtn8_56O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLDg47DMz-Jqdynx&oid=1879695507&tid=1036&nid=1652&e=.png"}